type: software
title: "mojotrees: Native gradient-boosted trees in Mojo"
authors:
  - family-names: Hendel
    given-names: Andrew
    alias: ajhendel
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mojotrees/mojotrees"
url: "https://github.com/mojotrees/mojotrees"
abstract: >-
  mojotrees is an experimental gradient-boosted decision-tree library written
  in Mojo, with a LightGBM-familiar Python interface and a focus on native CPU
  execution and Apple Silicon GPU acceleration.
keywords:
  - gradient boosting
  - decision trees
  - machine learning
  - Mojo
  - Apple Silicon
  - GPU
